<title>USA: PTI Holding in pact with Kellogg.</title>
<headline>PTI Holding in pact with Kellogg.</headline>
<dateline>HASTINGS-ON-HUDSON, N.Y. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>PTI Holding Inc said it began supplying bicycle helmets for Kellogg Co's new Frosted Flakes promotion &quot;Team Tiger Wear.&quot;</p>
<p>Its helmets will be cross marketed with Frosted Flakes by having PTI's helmet, name and logo printed on the back of over 31 million Kellogg's Frosted Flakes boxes, PTI said.</p>
</text>
